'''Laatvulon''' is a powerful [[ON:Dragon#Frost Dragon|frost dragon]] and the leader of the [[ON:Order of the New Moon (faction)|Order of the New Moon]]. He is the ancient enemy of [[ON:Nahfahlaar|Nahfahlaar]]. The [[Online:Dragonguard|Dragonguard]] called him the Black Beast, as he has a fearsome nature and ravenous appetite. Laatvulon is skilled in necromancy and frost magic.
